	Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!!!

>	1. Better Character Generation.  (Since everyone starts over and 
>		over until they get what they want, that should just be 
>		included in the game.)

	The best possible character generation is to make the player choose
	the stats. However I find that random character generation must
	be kept: it is challenging to play with mediocre characters, and I
	think that many players like it.
